---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { SITE, CONTACT } from '../../data/site';
import '../../styles/legal.css';

const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy Notice', path: '/en/privacy/' }];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | SAGE Makine"
  description="SAGE Makine privacy notice: which personal data we process and why, and your rights under Turkey's Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (KVKK)."
  path="/en/privacy/"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  noindex
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal Information" title="Privacy Notice" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs} />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal">
      <p>
        This privacy notice has been prepared by <strong>{SITE.legalName}</strong> ("SAGE
        Makine"), acting as data controller, pursuant to Turkey's Personal Data Protection Law
        No. 6698 ("KVKK").
      </p>

      <h2>1. Personal Data Processed and Purposes of Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Our website (sagemakine.com) has no membership system and no contact form that stores
        data on our servers. When you contact us:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> Your full name, phone number, and the content of
          your message are processed to respond to your inquiry, prepare a quotation, and manage
          the sales and service process. Data exchanged via WhatsApp is additionally subject to
          the terms of service of WhatsApp LLC.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email:</strong> Your email address and message content are processed to
          respond to your inquiry and to conduct the business relationship.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Our site uses no third-party advertising or tracking cookies. The embedded Google Maps
        viewer on some pages may use cookies set by Google LLC under its own policies.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Your personal data is processed solely for communication and business-relationship
        management, on the legal grounds set out in Article 5/2 of the KVKK: processing that is
        "directly related to the establishment or performance of a contract" and the "legitimate
        interest of the data controller."
      </p>

      <h2>3. Data Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Your personal data is not shared with third parties except where legally required, is
        not added to marketing databases, and is not transferred abroad (other than as inherent
        to the operation of WhatsApp and email infrastructure providers).
      </p>

      <h2>4. Retention Period</h2>
      <p>
        Data is retained for a reasonable period after your inquiry is resolved; where a
        business relationship is established, it is retained for the limitation periods set out
        in the applicable legislation.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights Under the KVKK</h2>
      <p>
        Under Article 11 of the KVKK, you have the right to learn whether your personal data is
        being processed, to request information if it has been, to request its correction or
        deletion, to object to processing, and to claim compensation if you suffer damage as a
        result.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may submit your requests in writing to
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.emailInfo}`}>{CONTACT.emailInfo}</a> or to
        <strong>{CONTACT.address.full}</strong>.
      </p>

      <p class="son-not">
        This notice is updated as needed. Last updated: July 2026. This is an informational
        translation; the <a href="/kvkk/">Turkish version</a> prevails.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
